(global_label "SENSE_R" (shape input) (at 205.74 109.22 0) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "d39daff1-17ec-4182-aa27-19da9e11db9c") (property "Intersheetrefs" "${INTERSHEET_REFS}" (at 205.74 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))))
(text "U8 ISO7762F: channels A-D carry SCLK, SDI, /CS, /MUTE from the XIAO (3.3 V) to the PGAs (5 V);\nE and F bring the plug-sense lines back. Side 1 runs from the XIAO 3V3 pin, side 2 from +5VA.\nF suffix = outputs fall to 0 when the other side is unpowered: the PGAs stay muted until the XIAO is up.\nThe RP2040 pins are not 5 V tolerant, so side 1 must stay on 3.3 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7b860852-2d6a-4614-81f0-4d0a17cbdc8b"))
(text "Bypass at U8: C39 on VCC1 (USB side), C44 on VCC2 (audio side)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 215.9 88.9 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "df0b8123-2612-4672-a6ec-7b2265259709"))
(global_label "LED" (shape input) (at 48.26 149.86 180) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid "7cbf20be-1f22-4751-ab67-9c34a83a1390") (property "Intersheetrefs" "${INTERSHEET_REFS}" (at 48.26 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))))
(text "MIDI activity LED on D9 (GP4), about 2 mA. USB side." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 86.36 151.13 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2f78e770-7279-4e83-9bc8-b3b8bf549030"))
(global_label "~{MUTE}" (shape input) (at 48.26 137.16 180) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid "827fd283-caeb-43e6-9b21-7a1c8c06fe37") (property "Intersheetrefs" "${INTERSHEET_REFS}" (at 48.26 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))))
(text "R15 holds both PGA2310s muted until the firmware writes its first gains: no power-on thump. Audio side, after U8." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 73.66 138.43 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b24c8743-eb53-4555-9385-6785ece569d5"))
(text "U9 is a Seeed XIAO RP2040 on header pins. Pin numbers are Seeed's: 1-7 down the left row from the USB end, 8-14 up the right row.\nIts USB-C is the only connector: class-compliant MIDI in (TinyUSB), 5 V in. The 5V pin is USB VBUS straight through, so it feeds the board.\nSPI0: D8 (GP2) SCK, D10 (GP3) MOSI, D7 (GP1) /CS, D6 (GP0) /MUTE. D9 (GP4, the MISO pin) drives the LED: bit-bang the 32-bit frame or leave SPI RX unassigned.\nNothing on the XIAO touches the audio ground: the four control lines and two sense lines cross U8, power crosses PS1. GND_USB is the USB-side ground.\nDIP switch on D2-D5 (GP28, GP29, GP6, GP7), closed = 0, internal pull-ups on. Plug sense on D0, D1 (GP26, GP27), internal pull-ups off (100k to +5VA on sheet 1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 33.02 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "efd2b1b0-b484-4a50-ba85-870a79508971"))
